With a gesture of your cloak, you drop a small incendiary device in front of you, creating a wall of thick steam of [3, 5, 5, 7, 7 (TL1-5)] length that burns creatures passing it for [146, 197, 236, 269, 299 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] fire damage and blocks sight for 5 turns.

At level 5 the action is so perfect that your foes even lose track of you entirely.

Damage increases with your steampower.
